WEBVTT

00:29.670 --> 00:33.580
What's the point of having a stairway 
when no one ever uses it?

00:33.580 --> 00:37.520
It's been a long time since you 
last came here to the seabed,

00:37.520 --> 00:40.040
problem child of the Great Hall.

00:40.510 --> 00:43.360
That was a long time ago, Alaira.

00:43.360 --> 00:45.440
I wonder about that.

00:45.440 --> 00:48.490
It sounds like you've been 
stirring up trouble again.

00:49.480 --> 00:52.540
I heard about your new apprentice.

00:52.540 --> 00:56.210
Already? Word travels fast.

00:56.210 --> 00:58.620
She might have the connection 
you're looking for, right?

00:58.940 --> 01:01.120
To the Brimmed Caps.

01:03.130 --> 01:05.900
No one's used forbidden 
magic in four years.

01:05.900 --> 01:07.600
She's an important lead.

01:08.390 --> 01:10.170
It's not about that.

01:12.010 --> 01:15.330
And she hasn't taken her tests, 
so she's not my official apprentice yet.

01:15.330 --> 01:17.260
Oh, she hasn't?

01:17.260 --> 01:18.870
It's too soon.

01:18.870 --> 01:20.520
It's a bad time for it, too.

01:20.850 --> 01:22.280
Oh, of course.

01:22.280 --> 01:25.270
At this time of year, the Dadah Range, 
where the test takes place...

01:25.270 --> 01:28.190
They'll be at their highest elevation.

01:28.190 --> 01:30.780
I wouldn't dream of putting 
someone through that test now.

01:31.310 --> 01:33.140
It could get them killed.

03:18.210 --> 03:19.850
Hey, Agott.

03:21.130 --> 03:24.350
Are you sure I should do this? 
Master Qifrey isn't even here...

03:24.390 --> 03:30.150
<b>The Dadah Range Test</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:27.920
You'll be doing it alone 
whenever you take it anyway.

03:27.920 --> 03:30.860
B-But I only just got here!

03:30.860 --> 03:33.770
I passed the test when I was ten.

03:33.770 --> 03:36.210
We all have to pass it 
to become apprentices,

03:36.210 --> 03:37.960
so you're in the same boat we were.

03:37.960 --> 03:39.200
I see...

03:40.410 --> 03:43.740
The first test is "Consent of the Crown."

03:43.740 --> 03:47.560
You can only take three contraptions 
and your components.

03:47.560 --> 03:51.860
You have to reach the summit of the 
Dadah Range purely on your own power,

03:51.860 --> 03:55.200
and pick the Diadem Herb 
that grows there.

03:55.880 --> 03:58.870
The Guidance Orb that points 
the way to your destination,

03:58.870 --> 04:00.890
and the Vapor Bubble for drinking water...

04:01.200 --> 04:03.740
That's probably all you can use right now.

04:05.140 --> 04:07.030
Go on, then.

04:10.540 --> 04:13.020
Um... and...

04:14.420 --> 04:16.280
Could I have the shoes?

04:16.870 --> 04:17.440
Shoes?

04:17.440 --> 04:20.450
Those shoes are contraptions too, right?

04:20.450 --> 04:22.410
Yours and Master Qifrey's...

04:22.410 --> 04:24.790
I saw the soles glow while 
you were flying around.

04:25.040 --> 04:29.290
So I thought... maybe...

04:29.620 --> 04:33.110
you could lend me a pair?

04:34.000 --> 04:37.830
That's too much, right?! 
Forget I said it!

04:43.820 --> 04:45.510
For you to borrow.

04:46.070 --> 04:47.810
So just...

04:47.020 --> 04:48.430
Thank you!

04:48.750 --> 04:50.530
Get going already!

04:52.420 --> 04:56.980
I forgot to mention it, but you 
only get to take this test once.

04:56.980 --> 05:01.520
If you fail, you'll never be allowed 
to be Master Qifrey's apprentice.

05:01.520 --> 05:03.740
You'll have to leave the atelier, too.

05:14.040 --> 05:16.280
I'm suddenly terrified...

05:17.500 --> 05:19.320
But I've got to give it my best!

05:19.320 --> 05:21.290
No turning back now!

05:22.790 --> 05:26.550
How do I use the Guidance Orb, anyway?

05:36.980 --> 05:39.820
Does it want me to go this way?

05:42.200 --> 05:43.600
Okay!

05:43.600 --> 05:46.160
I can handle a little mountain-climbing!

05:50.620 --> 05:52.000
I can do it!

05:52.000 --> 05:57.550
Agott said she passed when she was ten!

06:00.870 --> 06:03.630
If she could do it at ten...

06:07.950 --> 06:11.230
I can... also...

06:18.660 --> 06:19.780
No way.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.660
You mean...

06:30.470 --> 06:33.750
<i>That's</i> the Dadah Range?

06:39.040 --> 06:42.150
The Guidance Orb is pointing up.

06:42.150 --> 06:44.160
It's up there, then.

06:48.780 --> 06:51.500
I didn't realize they'd be floating.

06:58.760 --> 07:00.110
Ta-da!

07:00.490 --> 07:02.460
The shoes I borrowed from Agott!

07:02.860 --> 07:04.440
Fly!

07:06.470 --> 07:07.340
Huh?

07:17.680 --> 07:21.790
The Casting Seal is split between 
the right and left foot.

07:29.510 --> 07:33.090
Make sure they're perfectly aligned...

07:41.400 --> 07:44.650
Wow! I'm really floating!

07:52.530 --> 07:54.880
Master Qifrey was right.

07:55.210 --> 07:57.460
I'm like a newborn foal stumbling around.

08:01.140 --> 08:02.420
But...

08:06.920 --> 08:08.310
I flew.

08:11.680 --> 08:14.680
Flying can take me to 
the summit in no time!

08:15.680 --> 08:16.810
All right...

08:17.180 --> 08:18.540
I can do this!

08:23.140 --> 08:26.900
<i>You'll get used to it and be 
running around freely in no time.</i>

08:28.730 --> 08:31.490
<i>Get used to it. Get used to it.</i>

08:54.850 --> 08:57.550
Here's the application. 
Please process it.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.430
Right.

08:58.710 --> 09:00.490
Thotrey. Number 12.

09:00.490 --> 09:01.740
Right.

09:01.740 --> 09:03.100
If you'd live in the Great Hall,

09:02.200 --> 09:05.650
Let's see... number 12, number 12...

09:03.100 --> 09:05.690
you wouldn't have to travel 
so far for every little thing.

09:05.650 --> 09:07.080
Oh, here it is.

09:05.690 --> 09:07.610
You could bring your apprentices, too.

09:07.610 --> 09:09.760
I don't see the box, sir!

09:08.220 --> 09:10.360
The Great Hall is 
the witches' stronghold.

09:09.760 --> 09:12.360
There's one in the back, right?

09:10.640 --> 09:12.860
It has everything we need.

09:13.130 --> 09:16.050
Which is why I come here 
when I need things.

09:13.630 --> 09:16.470
There it is! Here we go!

09:17.380 --> 09:18.510
Here you are.

09:18.510 --> 09:19.620
Thank you.

09:19.620 --> 09:22.060
Sir, is this for that Outsider—

09:20.090 --> 09:22.870
Your hatred of the Great 
Hall runs deep, I see.

09:22.060 --> 09:23.210
Thotrey!

09:23.210 --> 09:24.570
I'm sorry!

09:23.210 --> 09:26.140
Keep an eye on those 
apprentices of yours.

09:26.140 --> 09:31.780
You never know what children that age 
might get up to without adults around.

09:37.020 --> 09:40.530
I think I'm keeping my balance 
better than before!

09:40.530 --> 09:43.150
Maybe now I can go a little higher...

10:24.150 --> 10:27.030
A brushbuddy! I've never seen one before!

10:40.090 --> 10:42.530
The shoes are caked with mud...

10:53.730 --> 10:56.320
The Casting Seal came off?!

10:56.320 --> 10:57.860
No way! Because I wiped it?

10:57.860 --> 10:59.500
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!

10:59.500 --> 11:01.970
I know! I'll just draw it back on!

11:04.410 --> 11:07.980
The Conjuring Ink spilled in my bag...

11:12.910 --> 11:14.450
What do I do?

11:16.750 --> 11:18.690
Is it all over?

11:20.830 --> 11:21.740
Huh?

11:21.740 --> 11:24.210
Hey, Agott. Have you seen Coco?

11:24.210 --> 11:26.870
It's about time for dinner.

11:26.870 --> 11:28.900
Coco's not here.

11:28.900 --> 11:31.500
She went to the Dadah Range for her test.

11:31.500 --> 11:32.940
What?! By herself?!

11:32.940 --> 11:35.170
But she just got to the atelier!

11:35.170 --> 11:36.590
Why didn't you stop her?

11:36.590 --> 11:37.880
C'mon, Agott!

11:37.880 --> 11:40.640
Most people take the test 
before coming here, right?

11:40.640 --> 11:43.390
Y-Yes, but...

11:43.850 --> 11:49.710
If she can't pass a test that simple, 
she shouldn't be an apprentice.

11:50.480 --> 11:55.160
I hate people who can't do what I can.

11:55.160 --> 11:57.600
I gain no benefit being around them.

11:58.260 --> 12:01.240
Especially Outsiders.

12:02.110 --> 12:06.000
Don't worry. She'll fail and 
come back soon enough.

12:06.720 --> 12:11.650
The Dadah Range is at its 
highest this time of year.

12:11.650 --> 12:15.180
She won't be able to fly that high 
with just my Sylph Shoes.

12:15.650 --> 12:19.540
She doesn't even know the rules 
or realize how dangerous this is.

12:20.890 --> 12:24.100
I don't want someone 
like that in our world.

12:28.300 --> 12:30.370
Tetia, are you not going to eat?

12:32.060 --> 12:33.520
I am, but...

12:33.520 --> 12:37.150
I feel kinda... down.

12:41.540 --> 12:42.590
Going for more.

12:42.960 --> 12:46.410
Am I seriously the only 
one who's worried?!

12:46.410 --> 12:50.420
There's nothing to do but wait 
for Master Qifrey regardless.

13:00.690 --> 13:01.890
It's no use.

13:01.890 --> 13:04.990
I tried drawing it back on 
with what little ink I had left,

13:04.990 --> 13:07.650
but I can't even float now.

13:09.110 --> 13:11.880
The ink soaks in and dilutes 
because they're still wet.

13:19.190 --> 13:22.530
If I drew it directly on
the soles of my feet...

13:32.580 --> 13:36.850
No! Magic drawn onto 
the body is forbidden.

13:38.940 --> 13:43.100
I don't know what kind of magic 
I should use at a time like this.

13:48.110 --> 13:50.560
I guess Agott was right.

14:02.740 --> 14:08.020
<i>Anyone can draw a spell, but that 
doesn't mean they'll be good at it.</i>

14:08.740 --> 14:13.650
<i>I guess you have to be a special 
kind of person to be a witch after all.</i>

14:21.500 --> 14:26.180
<i>They've all been drawing spells 
since they were children.</i>

14:26.600 --> 14:28.930
<i>It's not something I could ever...</i>

14:47.820 --> 14:50.310
Nice and straight.

15:07.170 --> 15:10.230
I had no idea this village had 
such a skilled craftsman.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.600
This is real magic.

15:18.150 --> 15:19.230
I have it...

15:23.560 --> 15:26.490
I have my own magic!

15:48.670 --> 15:51.560
<i>If I let a little water 
soak in and dilute it...</i>

15:57.020 --> 16:00.310
The mud's dried on my wet cape 
and made it a little stiff.

16:00.310 --> 16:01.960
I think I can draw on it like this.

16:28.890 --> 16:32.350
It's natural to have unsteady hands 
when you're learning to use a new tool.

16:35.260 --> 16:39.210
<i>Then I'll swap it for a tool I'm used to.</i>

16:40.920 --> 16:44.650
<i>My fingers begin to dance 
of their own accord.</i>

16:45.870 --> 16:47.090
<i>Freely.</i>

16:55.880 --> 16:56.870
There!

16:57.540 --> 16:59.080
Morning, brushbuddy!

16:59.080 --> 17:00.870
You've made yourself 
at home, haven't you?

17:01.960 --> 17:04.750
It's a pretty ugly Casting Seal, isn't it?

17:04.750 --> 17:07.090
To draw one properly, 
the sigil needs to be centered,

17:07.090 --> 17:09.630
and the signs are supposed to be uniform.

17:09.960 --> 17:11.790
He taught me that if 
the signs aren't balanced,

17:11.790 --> 17:14.640
it can put too much energy 
into one direction.

17:14.640 --> 17:17.890
I wanted to see what would happen 
if I made one long on purpose!

17:18.310 --> 17:20.630
I'm not sure if it'll work, though.

17:29.520 --> 17:30.860
You want to come, too?

17:31.860 --> 17:35.000
Really? Hold on tight, then.

17:35.740 --> 17:37.490
I'm closing the ring.

17:45.700 --> 17:48.280
What? What's happening?!

17:48.280 --> 17:51.260
Did I get the sign's direction wrong?!

18:24.710 --> 18:26.000
I did it!

18:26.000 --> 18:29.250
I'm flying with my own spell!

18:29.640 --> 18:31.760
A real cloak of flight...

18:32.040 --> 18:33.360
It's like a dream!

18:45.490 --> 18:51.950
I never thought helping Mom 
would help me learn magic...

18:55.160 --> 18:57.080
But the Diadem Herb is higher than this!

19:11.380 --> 19:12.550
The Diadem Herb!

20:12.100 --> 20:13.440
<i>Mom...</i>

20:20.530 --> 20:22.730
<i>Wait for me, Mom!</i>

20:23.950 --> 20:27.760
<i>I'll take responsibility 
for what I've done!</i>

20:31.960 --> 20:35.460
So Coco went to the Dadah Range 
to take the test for herself?!

20:36.970 --> 20:40.150
That's too dangerous! 
I have to go save her!

20:40.150 --> 20:42.470
But she'll fail if you interrupt her!

20:42.470 --> 20:44.970
It was too soon for her 
to take the test anyway.

20:45.580 --> 20:48.830
She hasn't been living around magic 
her whole life like we have.

20:49.910 --> 20:51.980
If anything were to happen to Coco...

20:52.580 --> 20:55.110
<i>She wouldn't be the only loss suffered.</i>

20:55.110 --> 20:56.410
There.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.430
Eh?

21:03.870 --> 21:05.000
Coco!

21:05.440 --> 21:07.230
Thank goodness!

21:07.230 --> 21:09.570
Coco! You're safe!

21:09.570 --> 21:13.160
I was so totally, 
totally worried about you!

21:14.480 --> 21:15.760
Agott!

21:17.200 --> 21:19.750
I got the "Consent of the Crown."

21:23.230 --> 21:25.300
This is the proof I need, right?

21:35.400 --> 21:36.530
Coco.

21:36.530 --> 21:39.690
It's extremely dangerous to cast spells

21:39.690 --> 21:42.950
without the proper preparation 
and fundamental knowledge.

21:43.280 --> 21:45.080
I thought you'd learned that already.

21:47.590 --> 21:50.520
You could easily have died back there.

21:50.870 --> 21:52.790
Never do anything like that again.

21:53.120 --> 21:56.040
I'm sorry, Master Qifrey.

21:58.140 --> 22:02.050
Besides, you didn't need to put yourself 
in danger to prove anything.

22:02.430 --> 22:05.050
You're already my apprentice.

22:18.980 --> 22:20.250
This is...

22:24.780 --> 22:27.120
The proof that you're a witch.

22:27.820 --> 22:29.580
It's both our pride

22:29.580 --> 22:34.690
and a shackle that rests atop our head 
so we don't abuse our magic.

22:44.800 --> 22:48.810
As long as you wear it, 
don't forget its weight.

22:50.300 --> 22:53.850
The pointed cap is watching your magic.

22:56.410 --> 22:58.060
Take good care of it.

22:59.230 --> 23:00.260
Okay!

23:01.280 --> 23:03.970
All right. Let's go back up.

23:03.970 --> 23:04.930
Okay!

23:09.080 --> 23:11.150
Guess we'd better eat first!

23:11.970 --> 23:13.980
Take a bath, too.

23:32.280 --> 23:34.330
The seed has sprouted.

23:35.440 --> 23:39.980
Episode 4:

23:35.440 --> 23:39.980
Meetings in Kalhn
